/*  hole-11-130481.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: CRASH 0xc0000005; chance false: CRASH 0xc0000005  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0, the series of number p1):
    Define v1 as a series of number.
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    State p0.
    Insert 5 into p0.
    Return p0.
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define v2 as a series of number.
    Pull a rabbit.
        v2 becomes cast f0 on (v2, v2).
    Done.
    State v2.
Done.
If chance:
    If chance:
        Define v3 as a series of number.
    Done.
    Otherwise:
        Define v4 as a series of number.
    Done.
Done.
Otherwise:
    Define v5 as a series of number.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.

